eço informado, para evitar que essa mercadoria seja devolvida.', 98.0, 98.0, NULL, 'Home & Living > Tools & Home Improvement > Tools', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-820li-moeepytxvc3q70', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F341202873%2F22429843465', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
