ossa empresa. Agradecemos pela preferência !! indication:4.98 Dimension (L x W x H):30x39x12.5cm', 1232.0, 329.99, NULL, 'Home & Living > Tools & Home Improvement > Tools', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-820lh-mmrv51iowf0nf2', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1232299933%2F52308307803', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
