o não foca. Garantia: 90 dias.', 49.9, 49.9, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Lighting', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-7r98o-mdnkuq9yuk6x52', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F413680793%2F23498424661', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
